scn 1
# Group awareness, adjacent: two moving formations of 16 of the SAME player run
# east on parallel routes 20 cells apart, ordered 10 ticks apart to points 20
# cells apart (inside kConvoyTicks = 90 and kConvoyCells = 32). The awareness
# exemption for one player's neighbouring groups must keep them from planning
# round each other: no detour, no waiting, no contact between them. Guards the
# exemption through W3 (plan 3.9 C1); no world-test source (new fixture).
name aware-adjacent
ticks 2400
seed 7
players 2
team 0 0
team 1 1
map flat 220 100
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
group A 0 m 16 rect 20 34 32 46 pitch=3
group B 0 m 16 rect 20 54 32 66 pitch=3
at 1 move A 190 40
at 11 move B 190 60
gate midA 100 28 100 52
gate midB 100 48 100 72
line far 170 0 170 100
region goalA 170 30 200 50
region goalB 170 50 200 70
